{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港美酒佳餚巡禮今日（29日）起一連四日舉行，適逢萬聖節，有檔主看好市民及旅客的消費意欲，料銷情將非常好。</p><p>另外有首次參展的麵包店帶來叉燒煎蛋菠蘿包，冀入場人士吃到「香港的味道」。</p><p>（採訪、拍攝：歐蕙瑩）【美酒佳餚現場情況有片睇】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:21:44.341767+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:49:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:15.134598+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.566959+00:00","content_hash":"0fda2d4f09db8a23b1fbd6551bff6d621ec5e844408dba316276dc924bf54697","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}